    "title": "Bomb attacks wound 18 in Damascus as Macron visits",
    "description": "DAMASCUS: Bombs exploded near the hotel where Emmanuel Macron was staying in Syria on Tuesday, a security source said, but the French president did not hear the explosions, the Elysee said, and he met Syrian President Ahmed al-Sharaa soon afterwards. Macron is said to be safe and unharmed and is continuing with his visit. Eighteen people were injured including four police,",
